<view class="page">

  <view class="h-section">姓名测试</view>
  <view class="notice">测一测名字的五格数理、三才配置、五行与音律。属姓名学赏析，纯属娱乐，不作吉凶断言。</view>

  <view class="card card-pad">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">姓氏</view>
      <input class="input" placeholder="如：王" value="{{surname}}" bindinput="onSurname" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">名字</view>
      <input class="input" placeholder="如：知远 / 一" value="{{given}}" bindinput="onGiven" />
    </view>
    <view class="btn btn-primary btn-block" bindtap="test">开始测评</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{result}}">
    <view class="card card-pad">
      <view class="name-main">
        <text class="name-text">{{result.full}}</text>
        <text class="name-py">{{result.py}}</text>
        <view class="grow"></view>
        <text class="star {{result.faved?'star-on':''}}" bindtap="toggleFav">★</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="h-section">五格数理</view>
    <view class="card card-pad" wx:if="{{result.wuge.available}}">
      <view class="ge-row" wx:for="{{result.geList}}" wx:key="lab">
        <text class="ge-lab">{{item.lab}}</text>
        <text class="ge-num">{{item.num}}</text>
        <text class="chip {{item.cls}}">{{item.lvl}}</text>
        <text class="ge-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="hr"></view>
      <view class="row-between"><text class="label">三才配置</text><text class="strong t-gold">{{result.wuge.sanText}}</text></view>
      <view class="h-note">{{result.wuge.tendency}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="card card-pad" wx:else>
      <view class="h-note">部分字暂未收录康熙笔画，五格数理暂不评；下方仍展示音形义与五行参考。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="h-section">五行与音律</view>
    <view class="card card-pad">
      <view class="row gap12 wrap">
        <view class="chip {{item.wxcls}}" wx:for="{{result.chars}}" wx:key="z">{{item.z}}（{{item.wx || '—'}}）</view>
      </view>
      <view class="hr"></view>
      <view class="h-note">{{result.soundNote}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="h-section">综合点评</view>
    <view class="card card-pad">
      <view class="h-note">{{result.comment}}</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
